OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban extended to
OL,4,Avulnerable across Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water is to expand water use
OL,7,Frestrictions for its customers across
OL,8,FSussex.
OL,10,FThe firm is removing an exemption for
OL,11,Fvulnerable people on the company's
OL,12,Fregister to its hosepipe ban from 9
OL,13,FOctober to "protect water supplies and
OL,14,Fthe environment".
OL,16,FAn exemption remains for health and
OL,17,Fsafety reasons and animal welfare,
OL,18,Falthough other exemptions, such as for
OL,19,Fdomestic window cleaning firms, will be
OL,20,Fremoved.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
