OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban extended to
OL,4,Avulnerable across Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of water resources Nick Price told
OL,7,FBBC Radio Sussex the "fairly unusual"
OL,8,Fexpansion of the ban that came into
OL,9,Fplace in July was due to lower rainfall
OL,10,Fthan expected.
